	(text "System-5 bus backplane (2009), one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Slots          SIX 36-PIN SLOTS, EVERY PIN BUSSED (X1, THE POWER CONNECTOR, IS NOT WIRED)\n  sheet 3  Power          POWER\n\nRedrawn 2026-10-26 from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fc0c6bd3-23f5-59c9-95e0-c987b926d8cc"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
